1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,000
The NTSB does not investigate alone.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
They provide technical expertise during fact-finding.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Manufacturers, airlines, the FAA, unions, and sometimes the operator become parties.

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,100
Legal or litigation representatives are barred from the party system.

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,900
The FAA is automatically a party by law. Every investigation. No exceptions.

6
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,200
The experts are in the room during fact-finding.

7
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,700
The people who would profit from a soft report are not in the room during analysis.

